comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T06:16:31.738Z",pi-agent,"Retain informational imports as closed context with structured resolution evidence, preserving source votes. Close applied verdicts only after successful remote operations. Reconcile live resolved threads, fixed/dismissed code-scanning alerts and merged PRs with dry-run and append-only closure history. Work items remain for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-14T06:25:06.337Z",pi-agent,"Dogfood: review reconcile --repo unbraind/pm-review --pr 1 through the built command dispatcher with the repo-pinned SDK. Dry-run planned 22 closures and wrote none. Applied reconciliation changed open ReviewFinding counts 22 -> 0; 22 closures. Retry applied 0 closures. GitHub reads only; tracker transitions use append-only history and structured resolution/expected/actual evidence."
  "2026-10-14T06:28:14.503Z",pi-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replacing only importFindings, isInformational, decide or evaluateRound with their origin/main bodies made the lifecycle HTTP regression tests fail assertions (open instead of closed, or closed pending items still counted). Disabling only the new reconcile body also failed its dry-run/closure regression. Restoring the functions makes the linked suite pass. Existing 24 modified history streams preserve every original byte and append new transitions. Linked lifecycle tests passed 5/5 before adding the separate non-thread failure/retry scenario; final gates cover that scenario too."
  "2026-10-14T06:33:52.673Z",pi-agent,"Linked lifecycle test execution passed 6/6, including non-thread vote failure/retry. The pinned changelog generator emits custom ReviewFinding links under reviewfindings rather than the registered review-findings folder; follow-up pm-review-changelog-links records this documentation limitation. Null top-level code-scanning states remain unknown and do not independently close findings. Host help duplication remains pending the Dependabot 2026.10.14 bump."
  "2026-10-14T06:49:30.866Z",pi-agent,"Final gates passed on the completed implementation: env -u PM_PATH -u PM_AUTHOR HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check, and the equivalent bun run release:check. Each passed 105/105 suite tests with zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across all 18 authored source files, and 1/1 packed acceptance test covering npm/npx and native Bun/bunx. Typecheck, lint, docstrings, zero duplication, production audit, pack allowlist, changelog check and publish attestation passed. Changelog generation/check also passed separately. Work items remain for orchestrator verification; claims released. No dependency bump or GitHub source mutation."
  "2026-10-14T08:55:47.178Z",codex-agent,"PR 9 round 1: repo and PR filtering already exists, but orphan notices can override persisted actionable verdicts and missing source identity can still receive terminal closure. Add persisted identity guards and verdict/severity precedence, with real-tracker regressions for missing metadata, foreign PR/repo, conflicting thread identity and orphan classifications."
  "2026-10-14T08:59:38.235Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: restoring only reconcile to the pre-fix function makes node --test --test-name-pattern=\"reconcile requires|reconcile orphan\" test/review-regressions.test.ts fail 0/2. Identity regression closes extra items lacking source metadata or carrying conflicting thread identity; orphan regression closes 11 instead of 3, overriding pending/fix/refuse and legacy actionable severity. Restored implementation passes both, preserves missing-metadata and same-thread foreign PR/repo items, supports a matching legacy thread identity, and rejects mismatched live snapshot coordinates before mutation."
  "2026-10-14T09:08:19.565Z",codex-agent,"Final verification: node --test --test-name-pattern=reconcile test/review-regressions.test.ts passed 2/2, and the existing lifecycle suite passed 6/6 through pm test --run --progress. Isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed 109/109 suite tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus native Bun/bunx acceptance test, with zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos. Coverage is 100% in all four dimensions over all 19 source files. Identity, typecheck, lint, docstrings, zero duplication, production audit, pack allowlist, changelog and publish attestation checks passed. Isolation prefix: env -u PM_PATH -u PM_AUTHOR HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Original history bytes remain intact and all new evidence is appended. Work remains in progress for orchestrator verification; claim released at delivery."
  "2026-10-14T10:17:22.225Z",codex-agent,"Round 2: verified all five requested findings against the PR head. Plan: configurable changelog link correction and branch validation, file-backed generator output beyond 1 MiB, format-bound action notice matching, permission-tolerant lifecycle reconciliation with skipped alert receipts, and replacement of import-derived evidence after applied verdicts. Each regression will receive a function-only behavioural revert proof."
  "2026-10-14T10:22:24.451Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 behavioural revert proofs against 8b67c52: (1) reverting only canonicalFindingLinks to the hard-coded prefix failed the alternate-base regression 0/1; reverting only runChangelog link validation failed missing alternate-base file rejection 0/1. (2) reverting only generateChangelog to the prior buffered spawn behaviour failed the >1 MiB regression 0/1. (3) restoring only isInformational failed the notice/finding pair 0/1: substantive text became informational instead of pending. (4) restoring only the lifecycle reader failed 0/2: merged reconciliation requested an unnecessary alert and denied alert reads aborted thread closures. (5) restoring only closeFinding failed 0/1: successful applied fix retained informational resolution instead of reason and commit. All source functions restored; targeted corrected implementation passed 7/7 before final gates."
  "2026-10-14T10:30:02.568Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 final verification: repo-pinned pm test --run --progress passed all four linked commands (6/6 lifecycle, 2/2 prior reconciliation, 3/3 changelog regressions, 4/4 new finding/verdict/reconciliation regressions). env -u PM_PATH -u PM_AUTHOR HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and the equivalent bun run release:check each passed 116/116 suite tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus native Bun/bunx acceptance test, with zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos. All 19 authored source files have 100% statements/branches/functions/lines; docstrings cover 58 declarations; identity, typecheck, lint, zero duplication, production audit, package allowlist, changelog check and publish attestation passed. The lifecycle history retains every original byte and only appends records. All five findings are valid and fixed; no refusals, dependency bumps or PM CLI/SDK defects encountered. Existing development advisories remain tracked separately. Item remains in progress for orchestrator verification."
